WEBVTT

00:03:26.577 --> 00:03:30.472
Pete, you have ALS."

00:03:30.472 --> 00:03:32.654
ALS?

00:03:32.654 --> 00:03:37.379
I had had a friend whose 
80-year-old father had ALS.

00:03:37.379 --> 00:03:39.440
I looked at my husband, he looked at me,

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.982
and then we looked at the 
doctor, and we said, "ALS?

00:03:41.982 --> 00:03:44.218
Okay, what treatment? Let's go.

00:03:44.218 --> 00:03:47.523
What do we do? Let's go."

00:03:47.523 --> 00:03:50.407
And he looked at us, and he
said, "Mr. and Mrs. Frates,

00:03:50.407 --> 00:03:52.356
I'm sorry to tell you this,

00:03:52.356 --> 00:03:56.884
but there's no treatment 
and there's no cure."

00:03:56.884 --> 00:03:59.729
We were the worst culprits.

00:03:59.729 --> 00:04:02.264
We didn't even understand